<section class="soovle-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="breadcrumb-heading-wrapper">
            <div class="breadcrumb-heading-content">
                <div class="breadcrumb-title-column">
                    <div class="seo-breadcrumb">
                        <ul class="seo-breadcrumb-list">
                            <li><a href="https://www.seo.com">Home</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://www.seo.com/tools/">Tools</a></li>
                            <li class="breadcrumb_last" aria-current="page"><span>Soovle</span></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="soovle-title-wrapper">
                        <h1>Soovle</h1>
                    </div>
                </div>
                                
                <div class="heading-intro">
                    <p>Soovle is a keyword research tool, now owned by SEO.com, that allows you to search for keywords across multiple search engines. It&#8217;s helps you find keyword adaptions based on the engines you&#8217;re targeting.</p>
                </div>
                            </div>
        </div>
