<section class="section-padding accordion accordion-section  half-padding-bottom" data-loaded="0">
    <div class="smaller-container">
                <div class="section__upper"> 
            <h3>FAQs on Soovle</h3>
        </div>
                
        
        <div class="accordion__container" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
            <ul class="accordion__list">
                                <li class="accordion__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                    <h4 class="accordion__heading js-accordion-heading" itemprop="name">
                        Is Soovle free?                        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="32" height="35" src="/wp-content/themes/seofx/assets/img/blocks/general/accordion/chevron.svg" alt="Chevron">
                    </h4>
                    <div class="accordion__content js-accordion-content" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                        <div itemprop="text"><p>Yes, Soovle is completely free to use.</p>
</div>
                    </div>
                </li>
                                <li class="accordion__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                    <h4 class="accordion__heading js-accordion-heading" itemprop="name">
                        What happened to Soovle?                        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="32" height="35" src="/wp-content/themes/seofx/assets/img/blocks/general/accordion/chevron.svg" alt="Chevron">
                    </h4>
                    <div class="accordion__content js-accordion-content" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                        <div itemprop="text"><p>Soovle is now owned by SEO.com, an SEO website dedicated to help businesses like yours understand how to get seen in today&#8217;s search landscape.</p>
</div>
                    </div>
                </li>
                                <li class="accordion__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                    <h4 class="accordion__heading js-accordion-heading" itemprop="name">
                        How do I use Soovle?                        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="32" height="35" src="/wp-content/themes/seofx/assets/img/blocks/general/accordion/chevron.svg" alt="Chevron">
                    </h4>
                    <div class="accordion__content js-accordion-content" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                        <div itemprop="text"><p>To use Soovle, all you need to do is select which engines you want to see keywords for and then enter your keyword. Soovle will automatically generate variants for all engines you select.</p>
</div>
                    </div>
                </li>
                                <li class="accordion__item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
                    <h4 class="accordion__heading js-accordion-heading" itemprop="name">
                        Does Soovle show any keyword data?                        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="32" height="35" src="/wp-content/themes/seofx/assets/img/blocks/general/accordion/chevron.svg" alt="Chevron">
                    </h4>
                    <div class="accordion__content js-accordion-content" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
                        <div itemprop="text"><p>No, Soovle does not show any keyword data. The main goal of Soovle is to help you find keyword variations for different platforms. Our <a href="https://www.seo.com/tools/keyword-generator/">Keyword Generator Tool</a> can provide you with data like search volume, keyword difficulty, and CPC.</p>
</div>
                    </div>
                </li>
                            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


	
